 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$, and the two vectors that are parallel to the plane (but not to each other) are ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$  and ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1.5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$\n\nSo, a parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\nr=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1.5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6d611d3d-5569-5f15-bdad-b3556e59c440"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6d611d3d-5569-5f15-bdad-b3556e59c440" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d611d3d-5569-5f15-bdad-b3556e59c440" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5e7d541c-0806-5629-b333-ae0ae03e2711" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bf93f0ea-48e2-58b4-984d-09176408a3cc" "answer-5bd93671-feef-59db-be6f-a0f31a8f3e20" "answer-5e7d541c-0806-5629-b333-ae0ae03e2711" "answer-1ac6b7cf-9cdf-544b-857c-d76a43c0147d" "answer-a96f0586-bad6-55c1-a8e8-5a58ec0473a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bf93f0ea-48e2-58b4-984d-09176408a3cc" :answer/id #uuid "bf93f0ea-48e2-58b4-984d-09176408a3cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1.5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5bd93671-feef-59db-be6f-a0f31a8f3e20" :answer/id #uuid "5bd93671-feef-59db-be6f-a0f31a8f3e20" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1.5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e7d541c-0806-5629